infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two limits, one error — only one is the real killer
  desc Both surface as "instantiation is excessively deep" — but depth rarely bites, breadth does
  compares
    - label Instantiation depth
      children
        - label Non-tail recursion walls out at ~50
          desc A single chain of nested instantiations hits the ceiling early
        - label Tail-recursive conditionals reach ~1000
          desc TS 4.5+ raises the ceiling for tail-position recursion
        - label Rarely what bites teams in production
          desc Usually a fixable restructure into tail position, not a slowdown
    - label Union cross-product
      children
        - label Cost = product of union sizes, not the sum
          desc Distribute over two unions and every pairing is materialized
        - label 50-member x 50-member = 2,500 per alias
          desc One innocent type alias; stack a few and you reach millions
        - label The catastrophic, editor-killing cost
          desc 10x autocomplete latency, paid on every keystroke by everyone
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f43f5e
